#10662
Dizza ghoul~
Dizza~
A tall, stately ghoul walks calmly down the road.
~
Dressed in bright white robes, this ghoul bears the standard of a Bishop.
Studying her closer, you realize its Dizza, Bishop Queen of the Ghouls.  She
must be journeying about this land trying to find converts and protect the
innocent from the grasp of the Elder Gods.
~
