On Bullhorn Road~
A small wooden bridge breaks up the dirt track of the Bullhorn Road, allowing
passage over a sparkling river.  On the north side of the road stands the
majestic pines that mark the edge of Spearfang Forest.  South of the road,
twisting vines and tall grasses of the jungle threaten to creep into the path.
